I hit Omeo Wreck for the first time. This is a very shallow shore dive looking at a wrecked ship and dive trail. Visibility was good but there was not a lot of large life attracted here today, but we explored anyway. I saw my first Australian Herring and Redlip Morwong.

## Dive stats

- **Location:** Omeo Wreck, WA
- **Date:** 3 October 2026
- **Depth:** Max Depth 4.7m, Average Depth 2.3m
- **Visibility:** 6-8m

## Highlights

Redlip Morwong and baby Crested Morwong.
